      "sha256": "e34f2f6843a3a1c24d70d71827e8515d4498746aa712bde2f8a36e5523407d5d",
      "variant": "",
      "captionSha256": "9e76fdbee72eaa0b7e47b62df623a31d6133d885bccb7ddb3cd73413fe5405f6"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "last_corridor-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "دارو، سوخت و نیروهای کمکی اصلی به محل‌های دریافت رسیدن. مهندس و کلیدهای فیزیکی اختیار با نفربر اصلی رسیدن. هر پنج دستهٔ تحویل ثبت شدن و ستون، پیش از بسته شدن مسیر به مرکز شهر رسید.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M04LastCorridor/Voice/fa/last_corridor-debrief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 17.68,
      "sha256": "a2e0ac23091a7dd200254a0fb08b0f950641a99d9718ccfac79ed481fd00f6d1",
      "variant": "",
      "captionSha256": "93e53e4d01543b97afafbcc42284bec91680714d961245a583140f4b01b22c70"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "last_corridor-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The repaired link and the protected alternate served the same city. Military and relief needs stayed in one plan. The medical teams, engineers, pilots and soldiers can now take their final roles without leaving Sahrin’s recovery behind.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M04LastCorridor/Voice/en/last_corridor-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.88,
      "sha256": "35f940b0d464c70fe8727ff41dba8f284801928153af1ed6fcd09ce53b281fee",
      "variant": "",
      "captionSha256": "7c4b4f61c003954c09e3e13a28525baf8e6be732809f5f1d0367bc8f92b561fd"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "last_corridor-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "بخش تعمیرشده و مسیر جایگزین محافظت‌شده، هر دو به یک شهر خدمت کردن. نیازهای نظامی و امدادی در یک برنامه موندن. تیم‌های پزشکی، مهندس‌ها، خلبان‌ها و سربازها حالا می‌تونن مسئولیت‌های نهاییشون رو بگیرن، بدون اینکه بازیابی سهرین رو کنار بذارن.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M04LastCorridor/Voice/fa/last_corridor-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 19.6,
      "sha256": "0fe6b9944cb1515e1aa67eca59cbdd3be9155c03013ff5d623f5d18728df5eca",
      "variant": "",
      "captionSha256": "b2cfb3a50c6d20401c0872941d5266699579b999113d0ec94aeb7d14c89caa78"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "last_corridor-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The delivered keys preserve bounded access; they do not grant permanent unilateral authority. The Relay complex is still connected to power, clinics, shelters, transport and communications. Those city systems must survive the final approach. I will keep your decisions explicit.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M04LastCorridor/Voice/en/last_corridor-debrief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 20.0,
      "sha256": "386784b396c123275bed762f7771f8cd1268e29863d628c1d340f5f954ed75f8",
      "variant": "",
      "captionSha256": "37f7e33784b083f5790c35e8a83d897b7f9f880b64e3e34bfa61eb61c100473a"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "last_corridor-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "کلیدهای تحویل‌شده، دسترسی محدود رو حفظ می‌کنن؛ اختیار دائمی یک‌طرفه نمی‌دن. مجموعهٔ رله هنوز به برق، درمانگاه‌ها، پناهگاه‌ها، حمل‌ونقل و ارتباطات وصله. این سامانه‌های شهری باید از نزدیک شدن نهایی سالم عبور کنن. تصمیم‌های شما رو صریح نگه می‌دارم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
